{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdMZVwREq8LYW9VEUD2ex","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DjPsARqLVJgNZakDdZ51gf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > \"$TMPDIR/diagnosis.md\" << 'EOF'\n# Initial Diagnosis: Test Infrastructure Permission Failures\n\n## Summary\nIntegration tests are failing with `Errno::EPERM: Operation not permitted` when creating temporary workspace directories. The root cause is hardcoded `/tmp` paths in test setup that conflict with sandbox write restrictions.\n\n## Confirmed Boundary\n**Exact Failure Location:** `spec/integration/mcp_workflows_spec.rb:366`\n\n```ruby\ndef create_run(suffix)\n  unique_suffix = \"#{suffix}-#{SecureRandom.hex(4)}\"\n  workspace = Workspace.create!(\n    name: \"planner-#{unique_suffix}\", \n    root_path: \"/tmp/planner-#{unique_suffix}\"  # ← HARDCODED /tmp\n  )\n  FileUtils.mkdir_p(\n    File.join(workspace.root_path, \"front\", \"demo-output\", \"agents-sdk\")\n  )\n  ...\nend\n```\n\n## Root Cause\n1. Test helper hardcodes `root_path: \"/tmp/planner-#{unique_suffix}\"`\n2. System sandbox restricts writes to `/tmp` (returns EPERM)\n3. Only `/tmp/claude-501` (via `$TMPDIR`) is writable in this environment\n4. Result: All 43 failing tests depend on `create_run()` which fails at mkdir_p\n\n## Evidence\n- Running tests: 395 examples, **43 failures**\n- Error: `Errno::EPERM: Operation not permitted @ dir_s_mkdir - /tmp/planner-mcp-plan-227f006b`\n- Direct /tmp write test: `touch /tmp/test: Operation not permitted`\n- $TMPDIR write test: `touch $TMPDIR/test: SUCCESS`\n\n## Test Failure Pattern\nAll 43 failures originate from test infrastructure setup failures:\n- 8 failures in `spec/integration/mcp_workflows_spec.rb` (shared `create_run` helper)\n- 7 failures in `spec/services/mcp_tools/collect_artifacts_tool_spec.rb`\n- 3 failures in `spec/services/orchestrator/terminal_session_runner_spec.rb`\n- 19 failures in system specs (`spec/system/`)\n  - These tests create runs via fixture or database setup that also reference hardcoded paths\n\nAll trace back to either:\n1. Direct hardcoded `/tmp` paths in test helpers\n2. Database fixtures or helper methods that create Run records with `/tmp` target_root values\n\n## Affected Test Files\nPrimary failure point:\n- `spec/integration/mcp_workflows_spec.rb` → `create_run()` helper (line 366)\n\nSecondary failure pattern:\n- `spec/services/mcp_tools/*.rb` → Uses same workspace creation pattern\n- `spec/system/*.rb` → Database fixtures create Run records with /tmp paths\n\n## Verification Evidence\n```\n$ echo $TMPDIR\n/tmp/claude-501\n\n$ ls -ld $TMPDIR\ndrwx------@ 1154 stockn  wheel  36928 Jul 24 23:04 /tmp/claude-501\n\n$ touch $TMPDIR/test-write: ✓ SUCCESS\n$ touch /tmp/test-write: ✗ EPERM\n```\n\n## Reproduction Command\n```bash\ncd /Users/stockn/Source/workflow-orchestrator/when-launching-a-task-we-should-be-able-to-add-a-4780\nbundle exec rspec spec/integration/mcp_workflows_spec.rb:4\n```\n\n## Implementation Boundary\nThe fix requires identifying all locations where test infrastructure hardcodes `/tmp` and replacing with environment-aware temporary directory selection:\n- `create_run()` helper in `spec/integration/mcp_workflows_spec.rb`\n- Similar helpers in other test files\n- Any fixtures or factory patterns that create Run records with hardcoded paths\n- Database seeds that reference /tmp for target_root or workspace.root_path\n\n## Notes\nThis is a test infrastructure issue, not an application logic failure. The application itself may be correct; the test environment constraints require the test helpers to adapt to sandbox write restrictions.\nEOF\ncat \"$TMPDIR/diagnosis.md\"\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1284,"cache_read_input_tokens":51164,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1284},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d2892c6-77f9-4067-a6e3-5a7da84f2051","uuid":"374e9b18-df80-4061-899f-190b9173d8c0","timestamp":"2026-07-24T21:04:42.730Z","request_id":"req_011CdMZVuxS3rjKMW81mmZEc"}
